{
  "understanding": "Pipeline submission advances a sender-local cursor; response processing separately updates shared replication progress. The decoder compares response term with request term and rejects unsuccessful responses before reporting progress. However, it calls AppendFuture.Response without calling Error, whereas the attached interface explicitly conditions valid response access on Error returning successfully. This is a descriptive interface/consumer mismatch requiring further investigation, not a confirmed implementation violation. Match reporting invokes commitment.match; the supplied source does not establish that this invocation advances commitment.",
  "requests": [],
  "delta": {
    "target_profile": null,
    "activities": [],
    "behaviors": [
      {
        "id": "B_pipeline_submission",
        "primary_activity": "A1",
